<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian bus crash kills 30, many of them children.</title>
<headline>Nigerian bus crash kills 30, many of them children.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least 30 people, many of them schoolchildren, died when their bus tried to stop for a police check and ran into a truck, Nigerian newspapers said on Friday.</p>
<p>The Daily Times said police removed the mangled bodies to a nearby mortuary after the crash on Thursday near Lagos.</p>
